{"seq":1,"slug":"key-value-stores","title":"键值存储","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/nosql-and-newdb/key-value-stores","wordCount":779,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"键值存储\">键值存储</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>键值存储（Key-Value Store）是最简单的 NoSQL 数据模型，通过唯一的键直接映射到一个值。它以极高的读写性能和水平扩展能力著称，广泛用于缓存、会话管理和实时数据处理。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    K1[&quot;key: user:1001&quot;] --&gt; V1[&quot;value: {name: alice, age: 25}&quot;]&#10;    K2[&quot;key: session:abc&quot;] --&gt; V2[&quot;value: {token: xyz, expiry: ...}&quot;]&#10;    K3[&quot;key: counter:page&quot;] --&gt; V3[&quot;value: 42857&quot;]\">graph LR\n    K1[\"key: user:1001\"] --&gt; V1[\"value: {name: alice, age: 25}\"]\n    K2[\"key: session:abc\"] --&gt; V2[\"value: {token: xyz, expiry: ...}\"]\n    K3[\"key: counter:page\"] --&gt; V3[\"value: 42857\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>键值存储</th>\n<th>关系数据库</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据模型</td>\n<td>Key → Value</td>\n<td>表/行/列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>查询能力</td>\n<td>仅按 Key 查找</td>\n<td>SQL 复杂查询</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Schema</td>\n<td>无模式</td>\n<td>严格模式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>微秒级响应</td>\n<td>毫秒级响应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>扩展方式</td>\n<td>水平扩展</td>\n<td>主要垂直扩展</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"redis\">Redis</h2><p>Redis 是最流行的内存键值存储，支持丰富的数据结构。</p>\n<h3 id=\"核心数据结构\">核心数据结构</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数据结构</th>\n<th>命令示例</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>String</td>\n<td>SET / GET / INCR</td>\n<td>缓存、计数器、分布式锁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hash</td>\n<td>HSET / HGET / HGETALL</td>\n<td>对象存储、用户信息</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>List</td>\n<td>LPUSH / RPOP / LRANGE</td>\n<td>消息队列、最近浏览</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Set</td>\n<td>SADD / SMEMBERS / SINTER</td>\n<td>标签、共同好友</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sorted Set</td>\n<td>ZADD / ZRANGE / ZRANGEBYSCORE</td>\n<td>排行榜、延迟队列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stream</td>\n<td>XADD / XREAD / XREADGROUP</td>\n<td>事件流、消息队列</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# String：缓存用户信息&#10;SET user:1001 &#39;{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;alice&quot;,&quot;email&quot;:&quot;alice@example.com&quot;}&#39; EX 3600&#10;&#10;# Hash：存储用户属性&#10;HSET user:1001 name alice email alice@example.com age 25&#10;HGETALL user:1001&#10;&#10;# Sorted Set：排行榜&#10;ZADD leaderboard 1500 player:alice 2000 player:bob 1800 player:carol&#10;ZREVRANGE leaderboard 0 9 WITHSCORES&#10;&#10;# 分布式锁&#10;SET lock:order:1001 &quot;owner-uuid&quot; NX EX 30&#10;&#10;# 计数器&#10;INCR page:views:homepage\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># String：缓存用户信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> user:1001</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '{\"name\":\"alice\",\"email\":\"alice@example.com\"}'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> EX</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3600</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Hash：存储用户属性</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">HSET</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> user:1001</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> name</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> alice</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> email</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> alice@example.com</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> age</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 25</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">HGETALL</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> user:1001</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Sorted Set：排行榜</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ZADD</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> leaderboard</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1500</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> player:alice</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2000</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> player:bob</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1800</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> player:carol</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ZREVRANGE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> leaderboard</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 9</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> WITHSCORES</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 分布式锁</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> lock:order:1001</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"owner-uuid\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> NX</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> EX</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 计数器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">INCR</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> page:views:homepage</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"redis-架构模式\">Redis 架构模式</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 单机&#10;        S[Redis Server]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 主从复制&#10;        M[Master] --&gt; R1[Replica 1]&#10;        M --&gt; R2[Replica 2]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Sentinel 哨兵&#10;        SE[Sentinel] --&gt; M2[Master]&#10;        SE --&gt; R3[Replica]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph Cluster 集群&#10;        C1[Node 1: Slot 0-5461]&#10;        C2[Node 2: Slot 5462-10922]&#10;        C3[Node 3: Slot 10923-16383]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 单机\n        S[Redis Server]\n    end\n    subgraph 主从复制\n        M[Master] --&gt; R1[Replica 1]\n        M --&gt; R2[Replica 2]\n    end\n    subgraph Sentinel 哨兵\n        SE[Sentinel] --&gt; M2[Master]\n        SE --&gt; R3[Replica]\n    end\n    subgraph Cluster 集群\n        C1[Node 1: Slot 0-5461]\n        C2[Node 2: Slot 5462-10922]\n        C3[Node 3: Slot 10923-16383]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>高可用</th>\n<th>数据分片</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单机</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>开发/测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主从复制</td>\n<td>手动切换</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>读写分离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sentinel</td>\n<td>✅ 自动故障转移</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>中小规模高可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cluster</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅ 16384 槽</td>\n<td>大规模分布式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"memcached\">Memcached</h2><p>Memcached 是纯内存键值缓存，比 Redis 更简单，专注于缓存场景。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>Redis</th>\n<th>Memcached</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据结构</td>\n<td>丰富（5+ 种）</td>\n<td>仅 String</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持久化</td>\n<td>RDB / AOF</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集群</td>\n<td>Redis Cluster</td>\n<td>客户端一致性哈希</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线程模型</td>\n<td>单线程（6.0 多线程 IO）</td>\n<td>多线程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存管理</td>\n<td>多种淘汰策略</td>\n<td>Slab 分配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大 Value</td>\n<td>512 MB</td>\n<td>1 MB</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"缓存策略\">缓存策略</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>读取流程</th>\n<th>写入流程</th>\n<th>一致性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Cache-Aside</td>\n<td>先查缓存 → 未命中查 DB → 写缓存</td>\n<td>更新 DB → 删除缓存</td>\n<td>最终一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Read-Through</td>\n<td>缓存层自动加载</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>最终一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Write-Through</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>同时写缓存和 DB</td>\n<td>强一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Write-Behind</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>先写缓存，异步写 DB</td>\n<td>可能丢失</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph Cache-Aside 模式&#10;        R[读请求] --&gt; C{缓存命中?}&#10;        C --&gt;|是| RV[返回缓存]&#10;        C --&gt;|否| DB[查询数据库]&#10;        DB --&gt; WC[写入缓存]&#10;        WC --&gt; RV2[返回数据]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph Cache-Aside 模式\n        R[读请求] --&gt; C{缓存命中?}\n        C --&gt;|是| RV[返回缓存]\n        C --&gt;|否| DB[查询数据库]\n        DB --&gt; WC[写入缓存]\n        WC --&gt; RV2[返回数据]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"缓存常见问题\">缓存常见问题</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>缓存穿透</td>\n<td>查询不存在的数据，绕过缓存</td>\n<td>布隆过滤器 / 空值缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存击穿</td>\n<td>热点 Key 过期，大量请求打到 DB</td>\n<td>互斥锁 / 永不过期 + 异步更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓存雪崩</td>\n<td>大量 Key 同时过期</td>\n<td>过期时间加随机偏移</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 空值缓存：防止缓存穿透&#10;SET user:9999 &quot;NULL&quot; EX 60&#10;&#10;# 过期时间加随机偏移：防止缓存雪崩&#10;# 基础过期 3600 秒 + 随机 0-600 秒\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 空值缓存：防止缓存穿透</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SET</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> user:9999</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"NULL\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> EX</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 60</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 过期时间加随机偏移：防止缓存雪崩</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 基础过期 3600 秒 + 随机 0-600 秒</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"持久化\">持久化</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>持久化方式</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>缺点</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>RDB 快照</td>\n<td>定期 fork 子进程生成快照</td>\n<td>恢复快，文件紧凑</td>\n<td>可能丢失间隔期数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AOF 日志</td>\n<td>追加记录每个写操作</td>\n<td>数据安全性高</td>\n<td>文件大，恢复慢</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合持久化</td>\n<td>RDB + AOF 增量日志</td>\n<td>兼顾两者优点</td>\n<td>Redis 4.0+</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# Redis 配置持久化&#10;# redis.conf&#10;save 900 1&#10;save 300 10&#10;save 60 10000&#10;&#10;appendonly yes&#10;appendfsync everysec&#10;&#10;aof-use-rdb-preamble yes\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Redis 配置持久化</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># redis.conf</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">save</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 900</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">save</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 300</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">save</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 60</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">appendonly</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> yes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">appendfsync</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> everysec</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">aof-use-rdb-preamble</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> yes</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((键值存储))&#10;    Redis&#10;      丰富数据结构&#10;      持久化 RDB/AOF&#10;      Cluster 分布式&#10;    Memcached&#10;      纯缓存&#10;      多线程&#10;      简单高效&#10;    缓存策略&#10;      Cache-Aside&#10;      Write-Through&#10;      Write-Behind&#10;    缓存问题&#10;      穿透 布隆过滤器&#10;      击穿 互斥锁&#10;      雪崩 随机过期\">mindmap\n  root((键值存储))\n    Redis\n      丰富数据结构\n      持久化 RDB/AOF\n      Cluster 分布式\n    Memcached\n      纯缓存\n      多线程\n      简单高效\n    缓存策略\n      Cache-Aside\n      Write-Through\n      Write-Behind\n    缓存问题\n      穿透 布隆过滤器\n      击穿 互斥锁\n      雪崩 随机过期</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>Redis</strong> 是功能最丰富的键值存储，支持多种数据结构、持久化和分布式集群。</li>\n<li><strong>Memcached</strong> 更简单纯粹，适合纯缓存场景，多线程模型利于多核。</li>\n<li><strong>Cache-Aside</strong> 是最常用的缓存策略，更新 DB 后删除缓存保证最终一致。</li>\n<li>缓存穿透用<strong>布隆过滤器</strong>，缓存击穿用<strong>互斥锁</strong>，缓存雪崩用<strong>随机过期时间</strong>。</li>\n<li>Redis Cluster 通过 16384 个哈希槽实现数据分片，支持水平扩展。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"键值存储","id":"键值存储"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Redis","id":"redis"},{"level":3,"text":"核心数据结构","id":"核心数据结构"},{"level":3,"text":"Redis 架构模式","id":"redis-架构模式"},{"level":2,"text":"Memcached","id":"memcached"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存策略","id":"缓存策略"},{"level":3,"text":"缓存常见问题","id":"缓存常见问题"},{"level":2,"text":"持久化","id":"持久化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分布式事务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/transactions-and-concurrency/distributed-transactions"},"next":{"title":"文档数据库","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/database-systems/nosql-and-newdb/document-databases"}}